# Zorin Optimizer (MVP)

A lightweight Linux optimization and app-installation tool for ZorinOS with a simple, modern GTK UI.

## Features (MVP)
- One-click app installer (browsers, dev tools, media, utilities)
- System tweaks: cleanup, animations toggle, startup apps
- Performance: power profile switch, swap on/off, zram detection
- UI: dark/light mode, icon pack install (Papirus or custom tarball)
- System dashboard: CPU, RAM, disk, OS info

## Prerequisites
Install system packages:

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y python3-gi gir1.2-gtk-3.0 flatpak gsettings-desktop-schemas power-profiles-daemon policykit-1
# Optional for icon installs and archives
sudo apt install -y tar xz-utils unzip
```

Ensure Flathub is enabled (the app can add it automatically too):
```bash
flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists flathub https://flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
```

## Run (dev)
```bash
python3 -m zorin_optim_tool.app
```

## Install .deb (simplest)
```bash
cd zorin-optimizer
DEB_BUILD_OPTIONS=nocheck dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc --no-sign
sudo apt install -y ../zorin-optimizer_0.1.0_all.deb
zorin-optimizer
```

## Build .deb (later)
Requires debhelper and dh-python:
```bash
sudo apt install -y build-essential debhelper dh-python python3-all
cd zorin-optimizer
DEB_BUILD_OPTIONS=nocheck dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc
```
Artifacts will be in the parent directory.
